{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"424","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Megacity"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The administration of the Tomsk Region firmly believes that it's time to become a megacity (that is, get population of one million). Instead of improving the demographic situation, they decided to achieve its goal by expanding the boundaries of the city."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The city of Tomsk can be represented as point on the plane with coordinates ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":"). The city is surrounded with "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" other locations, the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th one has coordinates ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":") with the population of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ki"},{"kind":"text","text":" people. You can widen the city boundaries to a circle of radius "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":". In such case all locations inside the circle and on its border are included into the city."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your goal is to write a program that will determine the minimum radius "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":", to which is necessary to expand the boundaries of Tomsk, so that it becomes a megacity."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 103"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ s < 106"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of locatons around Tomsk city and the population of the city. Then "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines follow. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line contains three integers — the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"yi"},{"kind":"text","text":" coordinate values of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th location and the number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ki"},{"kind":"text","text":" of people in it ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ki < 106"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Each coordinate is an integer and doesn't exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"104"},{"kind":"text","text":" in its absolute value."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that no two locations are at the same point and no location is at point ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0; 0"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the output, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"-1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without the quotes), if Tomsk won't be able to become a megacity. Otherwise, in the first line print a single real number — the minimum radius of the circle that the city needs to expand to in order to become a megacity."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The answer is considered correct if the absolute or relative error don't exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10 - 6"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 999998\n1 1 1\n2 2 1\n3 3 1\n2 -2 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2.8284271\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 999998\n1 1 2\n2 2 1\n3 3 1\n2 -2 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1.4142136\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 1\n1 1 999997\n2 2 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"-1"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"424B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/424/problem/B"}